WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.875
Anima is the map of a mind that persists, argues, builds, remembers, and sees.

00:00:07.075 --> 00:00:17.475
Six builders orbit one map. Trace remembers. Substrate hosts. S T C ships. S S T argues. Entorhinal advises. Reflex will see.

00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:23.550
Watch one task travel the map: persist, argue, build, remember, see.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:30.375
Trace is receipt number one: ten million tokens, filed, measured, replayable.

00:00:32.175 --> 00:00:37.675
Every node carries its true status, its next dated milestone, and its receipts.

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:45.825
The build order runs A first and D last: useful knowledge, then schemas, then discovery, then new hardware.

00:00:47.025 --> 00:00:51.950
And the map is honest about itself.  It is not a runtime.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.175
Where dates are missing, the map says so: milestone, owner pending.

00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:04.450
Nested worlds and physical builders stay on the map as vision, never as shipped.

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:09.325
Ambition you can audit.  Open the map.
